@startuml academic-service-class-diagram
title Level 3: Code - Class Diagram (academic-service) - FR-02\nOwner: Ahmed Mohamed Ahmed
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  BackgroundColor<<component>> #D5EFE0
  BorderColor<<component>> #2E8B57
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
hide empty members

legend right
  |<#D5EFE0>   | Class of a component |
  |<#FFFFFF>   | Interface / domain class |
  | Solid arrow, open head | Uses (required interface / class) |
  | Dotted arrow, hollow head | Implements (provided interface) |
  | Filled diamond | Composition |
  | Plain line | Association |
endlegend

interface IGoal <<provided>> {
  +createGoal(studentId, data): Goal
  +updateGoal(goalId, data): Goal
  +completeGoal(goalId): void
  +archiveGoal(goalId): void
  +restoreGoal(goalId): void
  +deleteGoal(goalId): void
  +getGoals(studentId, status): List<Goal>
}

class GoalService <<component>> {
  -studentProfile: IStudentProfile
  -repository: IGoalRepository
  -goalValidator: GoalValidator
  --
  +createGoal(...) / updateGoal(...)
  +completeGoal(...) / archiveGoal(...)
  +restoreGoal(...) / deleteGoal(...)
  +getGoals(...)
}

IGoal <|.. GoalService
class GoalValidator <<component>> {
  +validate(data): ValidationResult
  +isFuture(date): boolean
}
GoalService --> GoalValidator

interface IStudentProfile <<required - Student service>> {
  +createProfile(studentId, data): Profile
  +updateProfile(studentId, data): Profile
  +getProfile(studentId): Profile
  +getAvailability(studentId): List<TimeSlot>
}

GoalService --> IStudentProfile
interface IGoalRepository <<required - Database>> {
  +save(item: Goal): void
  +findById(id): Goal
  +findByOwner(ownerId): List<Goal>
}

GoalService --> IGoalRepository
class Goal {
  -goalId: String
  -studentId: String
  -title: String
  -description: String
  -targetDate: Date
  -priority: String
  -status: GoalStatus
  --
  +complete(): void
  +archive(): void
}
enum GoalStatus {
  Active
  Completed
  Archived
}
IGoalRepository --> Goal
Goal --> GoalStatus
note bottom of GoalService
SOLID applied:
S - GoalService only coordinates; GoalValidator each do one job.
O - new behaviour is added by new implementations, not by editing GoalService.
L - GoalService can replace any other IGoal implementation.
I - IGoal has only the operations its clients use.
D - GoalService depends on interfaces (IStudentProfile, IGoalRepository), not on concrete classes.
end note
@enduml
